---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import { byNewest } from '../utils/posts';
const personalIds=['lovev10','meeting','thinking','index'];
const posts=(await getCollection('posts',({data})=>!data.draft)).filter((post)=>personalIds.includes(post.id.replace(/\.(md|mdx)$/i,''))).sort(byNewest);
---
<Layout title="随笔" description="生活、相遇、思考与未被分类的私人记录。"><header class="page-hero container"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL NOTES</p><h1 class="page-title">无法归类的，<br />也值得被认真保存。</h1><p class="lede">这里离技术稍远一点，离真实的生活更近一点。</p></header><section class="container notes-grid">{posts.map((post,index)=><PostCard post={post} featured={index===0}/>)}</section><section class="container note-promise"><p>更多片段会在合适的时候出现。写作不是按时交付，而是对某个瞬间保持诚实。</p></section></Layout>
<style>.notes-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.note-promise{padding:80px 0 120px;text-align:center}.note-promise p{max-width:620px;margin:auto;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,34px)}@media(max-width:760px){.notes-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
